        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! Poubaomei alung rianra bam !",
            "Sansimei rui gumliam louna;",
            "Kapmei lev rianra zingbang khou",
            "Mikdui keina ai rui phu guang e.",
            "",
            "He! Poubaomei along geimei kapum,",
            "Nang banpa dai khou ti kan the;",
            "Lung geimei ti neihla kaipou,",
            "Tingmik thui ti neihla lou o.",
            "",
            "2. He! Poubaomei alung neila khang!",
            "Nang bam na neila khang makge;",
            "Thou kummei khou ai zuan ni cho?",
            "Ata ti neila khang nang na de.",
            "",
            "3. Lung ryanra muang rui akhang zing – zing,",
            "David Guangh kanlou mei pu rui;",
            "Rian ramei ata suliam lou ,",
            "Rianra nkhuai mei ai ni guang e.",
            "",
            "4. Reikhou kanaan ram bam kathui khou,",
            "Zaeng simei guay ti neihlaa lou ,",
            "Ryanramei guay nang ta thuan e,",
            "Akhang neihlaa liang mei nang na de."
          ]
        }
      }
